l winter . . . a country waiting to be set freeWitness the creation of a magical land in The Magician's Nephew, the first title in C. S. Lewis's classic fantasy series, which has captivated readers of all ages for over sixty years. This rack-size paperback features cover art by Cliff Nielsen and black-and-white interior artwork by the original illustrator of Narnia, Pauline Baynes.On a daring quest to save a life, two friends are hurled into another world, where an evil sorceress seeks to enslave them. But then the lion Aslan's song weaves itself into the fabric of a new land, a land that will be known as Narnia. And in Narnia, all things are possible.\n\nThis is a stand-alone novel, but if you want to journey back to Narnia, listen to The Lion, the Witch and the Wardrobe, the second book in The Chronicles of Narnia.","audioPreviewUrl":"https://audio-previews-media.api.yotoplay.com/audio-previews/6cf89344938084f1b92219093d02902dd188ec2aaf672f74a5a482d7c8844d80/D2T2SJZS8rVzhw2mkL9x6IDcwxRgCRUsSam7ucsbUpQ.mp3","seriesorder":1,"seriestitle":"The Chronicles of Narnia","cover":{"imageL":"https://card-content.yotoplay.com/yoto/pub/FO_2Kh3CheiPv_QNw_7U3p_sdIPOrXg1B2ZcQSJO0cQ"},"languages":["en"],"media":{"duration":14222,"fileSize":85658926,"hasStreams":false},"status":{"name":"live","updatedAt":"2023-08-10T16:03:48.511Z"}},"cardId":"2rmLm","createdAt":"2022-04-26T10:47:12.293Z","updatedAt":"2026-03-03T11:47:55.778Z","clubAvailability":[],"scanToAdd":false},"ownership":{"canAccess":true,"userHasRole":false,"cardIsFree":false,"cardIsMadeByUser":false,"cardIsInFamilyLibrary":false,"cardIsCreatedByFamily":false,"isAccessibleUsingSubscription":false,"isAccessibleAsPhysicalPlay":false,"isShareLink":false,"isReconditionCard":false,"inCardPacks":false,"previewAccessOnly":true}}